# The entrance spirit (GatekeeperSpirit) of the Seven Signs dungeons: a member of the Dusk cabal, which owns the Seal of Avarice and wins, gets the Dusk page.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/gatekeeper_spirit_dusk.golden
character Pilgrim 40
cabal dusk avarice
festival 0 100
sealowner avarice dusk
script script.teleport.GatekeeperSpirit
page gatekeeper/31111.htm
page script/teleport/GatekeeperSpirit/
npc spirit 31111 DungeonGatekeeper 10 0 0

action spirit
action spirit
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=spirit item=0 page=script/teleport/GatekeeperSpirit/dusk.htm
  S ActionFailed
